{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》帶領觀眾橫跨兩地尋找極緻美味！首站跟隨暉哥與大廚陳國強遠赴馬來西亞，品嚐南洋風創意粵菜；第二節則由李海銅與蔡景行（行仔）接棒，帶大家食盡中環街市的人氣美食。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>第一站：馬來西亞帝沙公園城「M公館」</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">主打充滿南洋風味的創意粵菜，四道招牌菜色令人食指大動：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">M公館</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址： B - G - 3A, Plaza Arkadia, Medan Residen, Desa Parkcity, 52200 Kuala Lumpur, Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"931eedb2-405a-4da1-bbc5-5570bd47db7d.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026BVgfzXVWzr1786676973.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"931eedb2-405a-4da1-bbc5-5570bd47db7d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d0d4114b-52eb-4a93-9a18-b165e113bef3.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026QBEYLI2eso1786676973.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d0d4114b-52eb-4a93-9a18-b165e113bef3.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3a3d969f-cf9c-4f8e-a67a-82eb1a19f104.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026gBF1MvcOwx1786676973.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3a3d969f-cf9c-4f8e-a67a-82eb1a19f104.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2f2cc05d-067f-44ba-ad1e-6815f030b490.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026MBuCjg9GDN1786676973.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2f2cc05d-067f-44ba-ad1e-6815f030b490.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>第二站：香港中環街市美食大搜羅</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中環街市匯聚各國特色小食，從鹹點、手搖飲品到甜品一應俱全：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">小正大福｜人氣手工糯米糍 全人手即日製作，經常在工作日下午就火速售罄：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">KEBUKE可不可熟成茶行｜質感台式茶飲</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2Kims kitchen｜韓式經典與潮流甜點</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4f7ffc7b-f6b3-4658-bc57-b2a2d1ef510e.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20269rBYUJxJZh1786676972.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4f7ffc7b-f6b3-4658-bc57-b2a2d1ef510e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a61738e5-febb-4c06-902c-a0bae02b8927.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026r4KVWwooyc1786676974.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a61738e5-febb-4c06-902c-a0bae02b8927.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"09609205-dac4-43f8-b1dd-edc688a78c5c.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20